WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:39.139 --> 00:00:40.707
[man speaking indistinctly
over walkie-talkie]

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.642
- FRONT OF HOUSE IS CLEAR.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:44.411
- HUH?
DID YOU HEAR THAT?

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:51.117
- MUST'VE BEEN NOTHING.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.173
- BACK PATIO'S CLEAR.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:58.051
[woman laughing]

00:02:05.391 --> 00:02:07.994
- [grunts]

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:24.910
- [gasps]

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.546
- SHH.

00:02:36.088 --> 00:02:38.057
- NOW IT'S MY TURN TO PLAY.

00:02:42.761 --> 00:02:44.763
- [snaps fingers]

00:02:44.763 --> 00:02:47.767
[gun cocks]

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:50.069
[woman screams]

00:02:56.675 --> 00:02:57.777
[guns cock]

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:00.446
- [gasps]

00:03:09.222 --> 00:03:10.456
OH.

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.893
- [chuckles]

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.294
CAROL.

00:03:15.294 --> 00:03:17.463
- [gasps]
TEAGUE!

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:21.568
- I THOUGHT I KILLED YOU
THE FIRST TIME, MR. TEAGUE.

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:25.304
I PROMISE I WILL NOT MAKE
THE SAME MISTAKE TWICE.

00:03:25.304 --> 00:03:27.273
- [breathes deeply]

00:03:32.311 --> 00:03:35.248
- YOU ARE A GOOD COP,
MR. TEAGUE,

00:03:35.248 --> 00:03:37.416
BUT A LOUSY FIGHTER.

00:03:37.416 --> 00:03:39.318
- UGH! AH!

00:03:39.318 --> 00:03:42.254
UGH! UGH! OH! UGH!

00:03:42.254 --> 00:03:45.057
UGH! OH! UGH! OH! UGH!

00:03:45.057 --> 00:03:46.626
OH!

00:03:49.228 --> 00:03:52.432
- NO! TEAGUE!

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:53.766
NO!

00:03:55.935 --> 00:03:58.671
- OH, SNAP, MR. TEAGUE.

00:04:02.841 --> 00:04:05.178
[body thuds]

00:04:05.178 --> 00:04:07.447
- SNAP INDEED.

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:14.487
- OH.
[chuckles]

00:04:19.191 --> 00:04:21.360
TEAGUE...

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.862
YOU SAVED MY LIFE.

00:04:22.862 --> 00:04:25.031
- NO, CAROL...

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:26.532
YOU SAVED MINE.

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:41.881
[bones crack]
OH.

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:43.382
OH, SHIT.

00:04:43.382 --> 00:04:45.051 line:92%
OH, SHIT.

00:04:48.054 --> 00:04:51.057 line:92%
[bones cracking]

00:04:51.057 --> 00:04:52.558
THAT'S JUST--

00:04:54.727 --> 00:04:57.363
[bones crack]

